      I'm a Data Engineer working as a consultant at <strong>Bekk</strong>, focusing on the <strong>financial sector</strong>. My day-to-day is built around <strong>dbt</strong> and <strong>Dagster</strong> — modeling data, orchestrating pipelines, and making sure the numbers people rely on are actually trustworthy.
